# APEX private denylist EXAMPLE for pre-submit-checks.sh Check 4.
#
# Copy to `scripts/private-denylist.txt` (gitignored) and add the operator names,
# email addresses, supplier proper-nouns, and any other patterns the public repo
# should NOT carry pre-consent.
#
# Format:
#   - One pattern per line.
#   - Lines starting with # are comments (skipped).
#   - Empty lines skipped.
#   - Patterns used as fixed strings (grep -F), so no regex special chars.
#
# Example patterns (replace with your actual private values):
# First Last
# org-handle
# user@personal.example
# user@school.example
